- The calculateMean() method calculates and returns the mean (average) roll, or 0 if there are no rolls.

- The calculateMedian() method calculates and returns the median roll, or 0 if there are no rolls.

Note that you will need to sort the ArrayList rollHistory in the calculateMedian() method to find the median, which is the middle value in an ordered list of numbers. If the size of the list is even, the median is the average of the two middle numbers."}]

